From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: amalige <amalige@bnl.gov>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:41:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add felix-to-slash: reboot the card into another SD boot
 file

felix-to-slash writes the PMC MULTI_BOOT register (0xF1110004), selects the
system reboot scope and reboots, so the BootROM loads BOOT.BIN (default) or
BOOT000N.BIN (-m 0xF000000N) from the SD card. -s only shows the current
values. Enables the busybox devmem applet it uses.
